// ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
// NEXUS — Prisma Schema (All Models)
// ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

generator client {
  provider = "prisma-client-js"
}

datasource db {
  provider = "sqlite"
  url      = "file:./dev.db"
}

// ─── Auth & Users ──────────────────────────

model User {
  id              String    @id @default(uuid())
  email           String    @unique
  name            String
  avatar          String?
  passwordHash    String?
  twoFactorEnabled Boolean  @default(false)
  twoFactorSecret String?
  emailVerified   Boolean   @default(false)
  emailVerifyToken String?
  passwordResetToken String?
  passwordResetExpiry DateTime?
  createdAt       DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt       DateTime  @updatedAt

  refreshTokens   RefreshToken[]
  workspaces      WorkspaceMember[]
  activities      Activity[]
  messages        Message[]
  reactions       Reaction[]
  timeLogs        TimeLog[]
  notifications   Notification[]
  employee        Employee?

  createdTasks    Task[]       @relation("TaskCreator")
  assignedTasks   TaskAssignee[]
  createdProjects Project[]    @relation("ProjectOwner")
  projectMembers  ProjectMember[]
  channelMembers  ChannelMember[]
  uploadedFiles   DriveFile[]  @relation("FileUploader")
  createdFolders  DriveFolder[] @relation("FolderCreator")
  fileVersions    FileVersion[]
  readReceipts    ReadReceipt[]
  auditLogs       AuditLog[]

  @@map("users")
}

model RefreshToken {
  id        String   @id @default(uuid())
  token     String   @unique
  userId    String
  user      User     @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  expiresAt DateTime
  revoked   Boolean  @default(false)
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())

  @@map("refresh_tokens")
}

// ─── Workspace ─────────────────────────────

model Workspace {
  id        String   @id @default(uuid())
  name      String
  slug      String   @unique
  logo      String?
  plan      String   @default("FREE")
  timezone  String   @default("UTC")
  currency  String   @default("USD")
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt

  members       WorkspaceMember[]
  leads         Lead[]
  deals         Deal[]
  contacts      Contact[]
  companies     Company[]
  pipelines     Pipeline[]
  activities    Activity[]
  tasks         Task[]
  projects      Project[]
  channels      Channel[]
  driveFolders  DriveFolder[]
  driveFiles    DriveFile[]
  departments   Department[]
  employees     Employee[]
  workflows     Workflow[]
  notifications Notification[]
  auditLogs     AuditLog[]
  webhooks      Webhook[]

  @@map("workspaces")
}

model WorkspaceMember {
  id          String   @id @default(uuid())
  workspaceId String
  workspace   Workspace @relation(fields: [workspaceId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  userId      String
  user        User     @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  role        String   @default("MEMBER")
  joinedAt    DateTime @default(now())

  @@unique([workspaceId, userId])
  @@map("workspace_members")
}

// ─── CRM ───────────────────────────────────

model Lead {
  id           String    @id @default(uuid())
  workspaceId  String
  workspace    Workspace @relation(fields: [workspaceId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  title        String
  status       String    @default("NEW")
  source       String?
  score        Int       @default(0)
  assigneeId   String?
  customFields Json?
  convertedAt  DateTime?
  createdAt    DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt    DateTime  @updatedAt

  @@index([workspaceId, status])
  @@map("leads")
}

model Deal {
  id           String    @id @default(uuid())
  workspaceId  String
  workspace    Workspace @relation(fields: [workspaceId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  title        String
  value        Float     @default(0)
  currency     String    @default("USD")
  stageId      String
  stage        PipelineStage @relation(fields: [stageId], references: [id])
  pipelineId   String
  pipeline     Pipeline  @relation(fields: [pipelineId], references: [id])
  probability  Float     @default(0)
  assigneeId   String?
  companyId    String?
  company      Company?  @relation(fields: [companyId], references: [id])
  closeDate    DateTime?
  customFields Json?
  createdAt    DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt    DateTime  @updatedAt

  contacts     DealContact[]
  activities   Activity[]   @relation("DealActivities")
  invoices     Invoice[]

  @@index([workspaceId, pipelineId])
  @@index([workspaceId, stageId])
  @@map("deals")
}

model DealContact {
  dealId    String
  deal      Deal    @relation(fields: [dealId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  contactId String
  contact   Contact @relation(fields: [contactId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@id([dealId, contactId])
  @@map("deal_contacts")
}

model Contact {
  id           String    @id @default(uuid())
  workspaceId  String
  workspace    Workspace @relation(fields: [workspaceId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  firstName    String
  lastName     String
  email        String?
  phone        String?
  companyId    String?
  company      Company?  @relation(fields: [companyId], references: [id])
  customFields Json?
  createdAt    DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt    DateTime  @updatedAt

  deals        DealContact[]
  activities   Activity[]  @relation("ContactActivities")

  @@index([workspaceId])
  @@index([workspaceId, email])
  @@map("contacts")
}

model Company {
  id           String    @id @default(uuid())
  workspaceId  String
  workspace    Workspace @relation(fields: [workspaceId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  name         String
  industry     String?
  size         String?
  website      String?
  customFields Json?
  createdAt    DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt    DateTime  @updatedAt

  contacts     Contact[]
  deals        Deal[]

  @@index([workspaceId])
  @@map("companies")
}

model Pipeline {
  id          String    @id @default(uuid())
  workspaceId String
  workspace   Workspace @relation(fields: [workspaceId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  name        String
  createdAt   DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt   DateTime  @updatedAt

  stages      PipelineStage[]
  deals       Deal[]

  @@map("pipelines")
}

model PipelineStage {
  id          String   @id @default(uuid())
  pipelineId  String
  pipeline    Pipeline @relation(fields: [pipelineId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  name        String
  order       Int
  probability Float    @default(0)
  color       String   @default("#6366f1")
  createdAt   DateTime @default(now())

  deals       Deal[]

  @@map("pipeline_stages")
}

model Activity {
  id          String    @id @default(uuid())
  workspaceId String
  workspace   Workspace @relation(fields: [workspaceId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  type        String
  subject     String
  body        String?
  dueAt       DateTime?
  completedAt DateTime?
  userId      String
  user        User      @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id])
  contactId   String?
  contact     Contact?  @relation("ContactActivities", fields: [contactId], references: [id])
  dealId      String?
  deal        Deal?     @relation("DealActivities", fields: [dealId], references: [id])
  createdAt   DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt   DateTime  @updatedAt

  @@index([workspaceId])
  @@map("activities")
}

model Invoice {
  id        String   @id @default(uuid())
  dealId    String
  deal      Deal     @relation(fields: [dealId], references: [id])
  number    String
  status    String   @default("DRAFT")
  subtotal  Float    @default(0)
  tax       Float    @default(0)
  total     Float    @default(0)
  dueDate   DateTime?
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt

  items     InvoiceItem[]

  @@map("invoices")
}

model InvoiceItem {
  id          String  @id @default(uuid())
  invoiceId   String
  invoice     Invoice @relation(fields: [invoiceId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  description String
  quantity    Float   @default(1)
  unitPrice   Float   @default(0)
  total       Float   @default(0)

  @@map("invoice_items")
}

// ─── Tasks & Projects ─────────────────────

model Task {
  id             String    @id @default(uuid())
  workspaceId    String
  workspace      Workspace @relation(fields: [workspaceId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  title          String
  description    String?
  status         String    @default("TODO")
  priority       String    @default("MEDIUM")
  projectId      String?
  project        Project?  @relation(fields: [projectId], references: [id])
  sprintId       String?
  sprint         Sprint?   @relation(fields: [sprintId], references: [id])
  dueDate        DateTime?
  startDate      DateTime?
  estimatedHours Float?
  loggedHours    Float     @default(0)
  parentId       String?
  parent         Task?     @relation("TaskSubtasks", fields: [parentId], references: [id])
  subtasks       Task[]    @relation("TaskSubtasks")
  tags           String    @default("[]")
  customFields   Json?
  recurrence     Json?
  createdById    String
  createdBy      User      @relation("TaskCreator", fields: [createdById], references: [id])
  createdAt      DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt      DateTime  @updatedAt

  assignees      TaskAssignee[]
  dependencies   TaskDependency[] @relation("TaskDependent")
  dependedOnBy   TaskDependency[] @relation("TaskDependency")
  timeLogs       TimeLog[]
  comments       TaskComment[]

  @@index([workspaceId, status])
  @@index([workspaceId, projectId])
  @@map("tasks")
}

model TaskAssignee {
  taskId String
  task   Task   @relation(fields: [taskId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  userId String
  user   User   @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@id([taskId, userId])
  @@map("task_assignees")
}

model TaskDependency {
  id             String @id @default(uuid())
  taskId         String
  task           Task   @relation("TaskDependent", fields: [taskId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  dependsOnId    String
  dependsOn      Task   @relation("TaskDependency", fields: [dependsOnId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  type           String @default("FINISH_TO_START")

  @@unique([taskId, dependsOnId])
  @@map("task_dependencies")
}

model TaskComment {
  id        String   @id @default(uuid())
  taskId    String
  task      Task     @relation(fields: [taskId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  authorId  String
  content   String
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt

  @@map("task_comments")
}

model TimeLog {
  id        String    @id @default(uuid())
  taskId    String
  task      Task      @relation(fields: [taskId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  userId    String
  user      User      @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id])
  startedAt DateTime
  endedAt   DateTime?
  minutes   Int       @default(0)
  note      String?
  createdAt DateTime  @default(now())

  @@map("time_logs")
}

model Project {
  id          String    @id @default(uuid())
  workspaceId String
  workspace   Workspace @relation(fields: [workspaceId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  name        String
  description String?
  color       String    @default("#6366f1")
  icon        String?
  status      String    @default("PLANNING")
  budget      Float?
  ownerId     String
  owner       User      @relation("ProjectOwner", fields: [ownerId], references: [id])
  createdAt   DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt   DateTime  @updatedAt

  members     ProjectMember[]
  milestones  Milestone[]
  sprints     Sprint[]
  tasks       Task[]

  @@index([workspaceId])
  @@map("projects")
}

model ProjectMember {
  projectId String
  project   Project @relation(fields: [projectId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  userId    String
  user      User    @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  role      String  @default("MEMBER")

  @@id([projectId, userId])
  @@map("project_members")
}

model Milestone {
  id               String    @id @default(uuid())
  projectId        String
  project          Project   @relation(fields: [projectId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  name             String
  dueDate          DateTime?
  completionPercent Float    @default(0)
  createdAt        DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt        DateTime  @updatedAt

  @@map("milestones")
}

model Sprint {
  id        String   @id @default(uuid())
  projectId String
  project   Project  @relation(fields: [projectId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  name      String
  startDate DateTime
  endDate   DateTime
  status    String   @default("PLANNED")
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt

  tasks     Task[]

  @@map("sprints")
}

// ─── Chat ──────────────────────────────────

model Channel {
  id          String    @id @default(uuid())
  workspaceId String
  workspace   Workspace @relation(fields: [workspaceId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  name        String
  type        String    @default("PUBLIC")
  description String?
  createdAt   DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt   DateTime  @updatedAt

  members     ChannelMember[]
  messages    Message[]

  @@index([workspaceId])
  @@map("channels")
}

model ChannelMember {
  channelId    String
  channel      Channel  @relation(fields: [channelId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  userId       String
  user         User     @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  joinedAt     DateTime @default(now())
  lastReadAt   DateTime @default(now())
  muted        Boolean  @default(false)
  notification String   @default("ALL")

  @@id([channelId, userId])
  @@map("channel_members")
}

model Message {
  id          String    @id @default(uuid())
  channelId   String
  channel     Channel   @relation(fields: [channelId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  authorId    String
  author      User      @relation(fields: [authorId], references: [id])
  content     String
  richContent Json?
  attachments String    @default("[]")
  threadId    String?
  replyToId   String?
  editedAt    DateTime?
  deletedAt   DateTime?
  createdAt   DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt   DateTime  @updatedAt

  reactions    Reaction[]
  readReceipts ReadReceipt[]

  @@index([channelId, createdAt])
  @@map("messages")
}

model Reaction {
  id        String @id @default(uuid())
  messageId String
  message   Message @relation(fields: [messageId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  userId    String
  user      User   @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id])
  emoji     String

  @@unique([messageId, userId, emoji])
  @@map("reactions")
}

model ReadReceipt {
  messageId String
  message   Message  @relation(fields: [messageId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  userId    String
  user      User     @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id])
  readAt    DateTime @default(now())

  @@id([messageId, userId])
  @@map("read_receipts")
}

// ─── Drive ─────────────────────────────────

model DriveFolder {
  id          String    @id @default(uuid())
  workspaceId String
  workspace   Workspace @relation(fields: [workspaceId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  name        String
  parentId    String?
  parent      DriveFolder?  @relation("FolderTree", fields: [parentId], references: [id])
  children    DriveFolder[] @relation("FolderTree")
  permissions Json?
  createdById String
  createdBy   User      @relation("FolderCreator", fields: [createdById], references: [id])
  createdAt   DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt   DateTime  @updatedAt

  files       DriveFile[]

  @@index([workspaceId, parentId])
  @@map("drive_folders")
}

model DriveFile {
  id          String    @id @default(uuid())
  workspaceId String
  workspace   Workspace @relation(fields: [workspaceId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  folderId    String?
  folder      DriveFolder? @relation(fields: [folderId], references: [id])
  name        String
  mimeType    String
  size        Int
  storageKey  String
  uploadedById String
  uploadedBy  User      @relation("FileUploader", fields: [uploadedById], references: [id])
  createdAt   DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt   DateTime  @updatedAt

  versions    FileVersion[]
  sharedLinks SharedLink[]
  comments    FileComment[]

  @@index([workspaceId, folderId])
  @@map("drive_files")
}

model FileVersion {
  id          String   @id @default(uuid())
  fileId      String
  file        DriveFile @relation(fields: [fileId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  storageKey  String
  size        Int
  uploadedById String
  uploadedBy  User     @relation(fields: [uploadedById], references: [id])
  createdAt   DateTime @default(now())

  @@map("file_versions")
}

model SharedLink {
  id        String    @id @default(uuid())
  fileId    String
  file      DriveFile @relation(fields: [fileId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  token     String    @unique
  expiresAt DateTime?
  createdAt DateTime  @default(now())

  @@map("shared_links")
}

model FileComment {
  id        String   @id @default(uuid())
  fileId    String
  file      DriveFile @relation(fields: [fileId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  authorId  String
  content   String
  parentId  String?
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt

  @@map("file_comments")
}

// ─── HR ────────────────────────────────────

model Employee {
  id           String    @id @default(uuid())
  workspaceId  String
  workspace    Workspace @relation(fields: [workspaceId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  userId       String    @unique
  user         User      @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id])
  departmentId String?
  department   Department? @relation("DeptEmployees", fields: [departmentId], references: [id])
  managerId    String?
  manager      Employee?  @relation("ManagerReports", fields: [managerId], references: [id])
  reports      Employee[] @relation("ManagerReports")
  jobTitle     String
  startDate    DateTime
  skills       String     @default("[]")
  bio          String?
  schedule     Json?
  createdAt    DateTime   @default(now())
  updatedAt    DateTime   @updatedAt

  absences     Absence[]
  headOf       Department[] @relation("DeptHead")

  @@index([workspaceId])
  @@map("employees")
}

model Department {
  id          String    @id @default(uuid())
  workspaceId String
  workspace   Workspace @relation(fields: [workspaceId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  name        String
  headId      String?
  head        Employee? @relation("DeptHead", fields: [headId], references: [id])
  parentId    String?
  parent      Department?  @relation("DeptTree", fields: [parentId], references: [id])
  children    Department[] @relation("DeptTree")
  createdAt   DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt   DateTime  @updatedAt

  employees   Employee[] @relation("DeptEmployees")

  @@index([workspaceId])
  @@map("departments")
}

model Absence {
  id         String   @id @default(uuid())
  employeeId String
  employee   Employee @relation(fields: [employeeId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  type       String
  startDate  DateTime
  endDate    DateTime
  status     String   @default("PENDING")
  note       String?
  createdAt  DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt  DateTime @updatedAt

  @@map("absences")
}

// ─── Automation ────────────────────────────

model Workflow {
  id          String    @id @default(uuid())
  workspaceId String
  workspace   Workspace @relation(fields: [workspaceId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  name        String
  trigger     Json
  nodes       Json?
  edges       Json?
  active      Boolean   @default(false)
  createdAt   DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt   DateTime  @updatedAt

  executions  WorkflowExecution[]

  @@index([workspaceId])
  @@map("workflows")
}

model WorkflowExecution {
  id          String    @id @default(uuid())
  workflowId  String
  workflow    Workflow   @relation(fields: [workflowId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  status      String    @default("RUNNING")
  startedAt   DateTime  @default(now())
  completedAt DateTime?
  log         Json?

  @@map("workflow_executions")
}

// ─── Notifications ─────────────────────────

model Notification {
  id          String    @id @default(uuid())
  workspaceId String
  workspace   Workspace @relation(fields: [workspaceId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  userId      String
  user        User      @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  type        String
  title       String
  body        String?
  read        Boolean   @default(false)
  link        String?
  createdAt   DateTime  @default(now())

  @@index([userId, read])
  @@index([workspaceId])
  @@map("notifications")
}

// ─── System ────────────────────────────────

model AuditLog {
  id          String    @id @default(uuid())
  workspaceId String
  workspace   Workspace @relation(fields: [workspaceId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  userId      String
  user        User      @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id])
  action      String
  entityType  String
  entityId    String
  before      Json?
  after       Json?
  createdAt   DateTime  @default(now())

  @@index([workspaceId, createdAt])
  @@map("audit_logs")
}

model Webhook {
  id          String    @id @default(uuid())
  workspaceId String
  workspace   Workspace @relation(fields: [workspaceId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  url         String
  events      String    @default("[]")
  secret      String?
  active      Boolean   @default(true)
  createdAt   DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt   DateTime  @updatedAt

  @@map("webhooks")
}
